  "details": "I clicked the age verification thing once, and got a mail sent to me. However I forgot about it, thinking I'd complete it later.\n\nNow the session in the mail I got has timed out, and I need a new e-mail with a new session, but the Re-send Age Verification button is not working.\n\nEdit: Ah, it would seem I have run out of VRC+ and failed to notice (I thought I had one more day).\n\n         It could be useful to show this more clearly in cases like this, although I appreciate it is an edge case.\n\n        Guess I'll buy one more month and give it a try again...",
